5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry our instincts about promise have not aged well. I want to see what finished awards actually delivered.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Money is easy to vote. Trained hands are not. I need to know who is genuinely available here now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Nothing runs in isolation. I am concerned about the state of the shared services we all rely on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The headline grant size is static, but what it buys is shrinking. I need to know which costs are now on us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Too many awards lost time to non-scientific interruptions. I want to know where work in this field actually gets interrupted.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a fair point. The value of the money matters as much as the amount.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, shared services failing is a silent killer. I agree we must check the infrastructure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If the facilities are strained, the science suffers regardless of the proposal quality.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the ledgers and the computing agreement to see where the pressure is.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will check the incident logs and the repository turnaround to see where the bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the closeout files and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments to gauge crew strength.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the accreditation records and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the national computing agreement to see if simulation costs are covered.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also look at the station records from partner field sites to see if external factors are a risk.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the data says before we judge the candidates.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. We need to know if we have the people to do the work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The state of the facilities will determine if the proposed timelines are realistic.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Understanding the cost structure is essential for a fair comparison.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can identify the friction points before they derail the project.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
